<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Tuesday 121,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Tuesday 121,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Tuesday's actual receipts 121,000 head at interior Iowa Minnesota. Opening trade was not well established. Early sales of barrows and gilts traded steady to $0.50 lower than the mid-session Tuesday. Top $51.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>			   Country		  Plant</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    49.00 -50.00	   50.00 -51.00</p>
<p>few			48.50  50.50	   49.50  51.50</p>
<p>Sows - mostly steady. Top $49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  40.00 -41.50	   40.00 -43.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   42.00 -44.00	   44.00 -45.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    45.00 -48.00	   46.50 -49.00</p>
